import <wdoc.wcl>

concept wskill_concept {
    name = "What is it?"
    summary = "A wskill is a self contanied unit of knowledge that can be shared"
    related = [process, entity, fact]
    body {
        p <<BODY
            The primary idea of a wskill is to be a unit that has self contained knowledge on a specific topic.
        BODY

        p <<BODY
            This means someone can pick the wskill file up and use it to learn the target skill or find processes inside it to
            do acctivites they need to do some work. An added bonus is we also get an AI Skill that we can use with a AI coding
            agent like claude code.
        BODY
    }
}